            "tooltip": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Shows every SKU–plant pair with sellable inventory today. Each row burns that inventory down against its own weekly forecast (item-location) to find when it runs out.  Sellable Now — inventory available to ship (TQOH − On Hold − Blocked − Aged Hold). Forecast 13w — demand for that SKU at that plant over the next 13 weeks. DFC (days) — days of forecast covered by current inventory. Stockout Week — week the inventory runs out (W+n from snapshot); \"Sin riesgo\" = beyond the horizon. Gap — demand not covered within 13 weeks. Recommended Action — DFC vs the item''s DFC targets (98.5% / 85% CFR).'"
